-- ============================================================================
-- EC4 EXPERT DEEP SEED: Decision Analysis & Value of Information, advanced
-- tier. COMPLETES THE EC4 LADDER.
--
-- Six modules, 26 lessons, 132 questions (15 per module bank plus a 42
-- question final exam). The structure row is GENERATED from the tier's
-- manifest.json rather than hand typed.
--
-- What this tier owns: WHEN THE NUMBERS CANNOT BE TRUSTED. Typed inputs that
-- contradict each other and why the repaired VOI Analyzer refuses or withholds
-- them; bigger lotteries; the Decision Studio brief and a Monte Carlo payoff
-- at its mean; refusals and silent defaults; and numbers to distrust (a risk
-- neutral choice, an exact tie reported as a recommendation, a card rounded
-- before the verdict).
--
-- THE ENGINE FACT THIS TIER OWNS. EC4-0 (engines #177): percents that are not
-- chances are refused with the sum named in percent, and chances that cannot
-- all be true together withhold the value of information while EMV without
-- information and EVPI stand. The values the Analyzer printed before the
-- repair, below zero and above EVPI, are taught as history.
--
-- THE TRAP THE TIER IS BUILT ON. A rounded posterior, a half percent of
-- slack and a first-listed tie each decide a result silently; the tier makes
-- a reader find where.
-- ============================================================================

